    {
      "subId": "2402101",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240210101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240210101": {
            "id": "240210101",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "Ow... Why is that box so heavy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210102"
            ]
          },
          "240210102": {
            "id": "240210102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you okay?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210103"
            ]
          },
          "240210103": {
            "id": "240210103",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "We meet again, Honorary Senior Researcher. I apologize... My... my lower back seems to have been injured, it hurts so badly...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210104"
            ]
          },
          "240210104": {
            "id": "240210104",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "I was planning to move a box over here and organize the materials inside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210105"
            ]
          },
          "240210105": {
            "id": "240210105",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "I... I never imagined the box would be so heavy, and I couldn't quite keep my footing when I lifted it, so all the strain went straight to my waist...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210106"
            ]
          },
          "240210106": {
            "id": "240210106",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "Now I... It feels like my waist is broken, ow...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210109"
            ]
          },
          "240210109": {
            "id": "240210109",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "No, no need... I've hurt my lower back before, I just need to rest a bit...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210110"
            ]
          },
          "240210110": {
            "id": "240210110",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon wonders just how many files are inside, for it to be this heavy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210111"
            ]
          },
          "240210111": {
            "id": "240210111",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "There must be... Well, a ton of files. After all, the Institute once promoted a style of work called \"Document Everything\" for some time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210112"
            ]
          },
          "240210112": {
            "id": "240210112",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "Basically, it meant that absolutely a single thing at the Institute had to be physically documented.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210113"
            ]
          },
          "240210113": {
            "id": "240210113",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "After they began promoting this policy, the Institute's paper usage increased 5 times...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210114"
            ]
          },
          "240210114": {
            "id": "240210114",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "And because there were so many documents, every single office was forced to create a \"document management\" post just to categorize and sort all the documentation...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210115"
            ]
          },
          "240210115": {
            "id": "240210115",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So everything had to be written down? That sounds really annoying...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210116"
            ]
          },
          "240210116": {
            "id": "240210116",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "It was! Later, that style was slowly phased out, and only implemented to a limited extent.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240210117"
            ]
          },
          "240210117": {
            "id": "240210117",
            "speakerId": 5256,
            "speakerName": "Chalmet",
            "text": "But let's not discuss that now... Honorary Senior Researcher, can you help me handle the file box? Though my waist hurts, I still need to organize the files inside..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
